# The Columns view: the folder above, the folder here, what is under the cursor.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/colonne.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Type "vv"
Sleep 600ms
Down 3
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/colonne.png"
Sleep 1s
